1029
00:43:52,000 --> 00:43:53,333
Kalian orang baik.

1030
00:43:53,416 --> 00:43:55,625
Warga teladan.

1031
00:43:55,708 --> 00:43:57,913
Contoh nilai-nilai,

1032
