1045
00:44:26,125 --> 00:44:28,541
Kerja paksa.
Kau berbuat, kau tanggung.

1046
00:44:28,625 --> 00:44:33,458
Aku mikir yang lebih keras.

1047
00:44:36,875 --> 00:44:38,375
- Hukuman mati.
- Iya.

1048
00:44:38,458 --> 00:44:39,541
Sialan.

1049
