Itu tradisi Spanyol asli.

1050
00:44:42,304 --> 00:44:43,727
Itu berhasil.

1051
00:44:43,833 --> 00:44:45,125
Kenapa dihapus?

1052
00:44:45,208 --> 00:44:46,759
Sejak dihapus,

1053
