- Berapa?

1204
00:52:41,833 --> 00:52:44,125
Untuk bensin, 300…

1205
00:52:44,208 --> 00:52:46,791
Tanganku berkeringat,
dan tintanya luntur.

1206
00:52:46,875 --> 00:52:49,500
Maaf. Aku gugup di sini, Torrente.

1207
00:52:50,875 --> 00:52:52,791
